Preheat the oven to 180°C. Combine the eggs and oil in one bowl, and the dry ingredients in another. Mix the egg mixture, carrots and nuts into the dry ingredients until just combined. Bake until the cake springs back or a skewer comes out clean. Grandmum normally doubled this recipe to make one full-size cake.

